\caption(The blue curve retains 257 native evaluations; five checked native outputs sit on it. Gray points are the original x1=.5. Both the off-diagonal derivative and determinant vary with the earlier coordinate. The actual triangular Jacobian and dependency-ordered inverse match the formulas.)
