> Trace the executed compact autoregressive architecture

Each conditioner stores32 hidden weights,16 hidden biases,64 head weights and
four head biases:116 values. Four give 464; global log_scale adds two. The total
is **466 stored values in 17 tensors**, including160 masked kernel coordinates.
Hidden W uses normal deviation .3 and bias .05; heads use deviation .01 and
zero bias. Source seed9603 warms forward blocks in order, then the global scale.
The optional TensorFlow initial-array directory is absent, so the original auto
default chooses that native initialization. The graph groups two autoregressions
per stage,232 values each, and counts the actual leaves including masked entries.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/maf_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){
 namespace n=dm::nn;n::ParameterStore p(9603);
 n::Module model([&](const n::Tensor& x){auto o=n::models::MafDensity(p,x);
  n::model_stage("Autoregressions 0 / 1",x,o.coupling1);
  n::model_stage("Autoregressions 2 / 3",o.coupling1,o.unscaled);
  return n::model_stage("Positive diagonal scale",o.unscaled,o.latent);
 },"MAF: 466 values / 17 leaves");
 n::ModelPlotOptions options;options.detail=n::ModelPlotDetail::Blocks;options.sizing.minimum_extent=2;options.sizing.max_planes=2;
 auto figure=model.plot(n::zeros({1,2}),options);
 if(figure.parameter_count()!=466||p.size()!=17)throw std::runtime_error("Executed MAF census");
 figure.save_svg("build/maf_network.svg");
}
